d9-9c32-45bc-a615-f28e539ff52a" class="r-qpxp9u alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, ear seeds are designed to stay securely in place and can be worn while sleeping. It’s best to avoid soaking them directly in water, so showering with care is advised.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="47d78dbb-1bd5-404c-847c-1bd518f85027" class="r-10gkeyr" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="cb4e334d-ca12-41c9-bf35-148d93e30825" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rber2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-l2uz2l"><div data-rid="61b08c37-3475-4c4c-a157-a3083e58f08e" class="r-9ypgsg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do ear seeds compare to acupuncture?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2e673cae-b178-49ae-b302-ff89dfe2604e" class="r-dhfp7n" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-18selin" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rber2:"><div data-rid="b55672e7-dd9e-4f44-8980-da28b5223273" class="r-1tcm2cn"><div data-rid="5adcd68b-8833-489e-8ae2-a54ec354bcf2" class="r-1b03mrk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Ear seeds use the same acupressure points targeted in acupuncture but without needles. They offer a simple, drug-free way to stimulate these points throughout the day at your convenience.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="58898a5a-ded5-4e75-b345-847ce7756397" class="r-6wiisn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="35d69339-1481-412b-ab12-7cbfbcca50aa" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rder2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-v5p6ad"><div data-rid="44401ec7-b1ff-47e9-b6ab-c5599dfda233" class="r-1dj6qz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>I’ve never tried Traditional Chinese Medicine before—will this work for me?</p></span></div><div data-rid="aa20bb5a-fee1-407e-8e31-ba72857b897d" class="r-79n9ni" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-q2lcls" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rder2:"><div data-rid="f582450a-1077-4fd6-bcbd-c35c0de45613" class="r-16u57l"><div data-rid="eb3e14a2-b24d-40df-8ad7-4f66419c7f61" class="r-12k4mqf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>East Healing’s ear seeds are easy to use and come with clear instructions. They’re designed to support your wellbeing naturally, whether you’re new to TCM or experienced.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d1681221-85ae-44b6-9934-81a5f8dd29c5" class="r-3lcel4" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="09cc88d2-2ff6-4714-8e8f-7f531bda9a83" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rfer2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1cjkjsb"><div data-rid="8094f6af-c834-4ac4-bc53-0fa5f5c0da39" class="r-1tc8bft alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I use ear seeds alongside medication or other treatments?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ffaefd8e-e8b0-4206-963d-6c69c8624f13" class="r-1ls09g3" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-zwmhxy" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><pa